<title>USA: Battle Creek, Mich., won by McDonald &amp; Co. [CORRECTED 20:35 GMT]</title>
<headline>Battle Creek, Mich., won by McDonald &amp; Co. [CORRECTED 20:35 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects company in headline and text to McDonald &amp; Co. from PaineWebber Inc.)</p>
<p>McDonald &amp; Co. said it won $12.430 million of Battle Creek, Mich., water supply system revenue bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.4686 percent. (Corrects from 5.459 percent)</p>
</text>
